{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2211505,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211505,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":221150506,"next_line_ids":[221150507],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1624,"speaker_text_hash":4046583941,"speaker":"常九爷","speaker_raw":"常九爷","text_hash":3205577325,"text":"哦，是我写给我妹子的故事，这几章都是废稿了。你是不知道啊，小时候，这丫头天天缠着我，要我给她讲故事。","raw_text":"哦，是我写给我妹子的故事，这几章都是废稿了。你是不知道啊，小时候，这丫头天天缠着我，要我给她讲故事。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211505.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2211505,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211505,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":221150507,"next_line_ids":[221150508],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1624,"speaker_text_hash":4046583941,"speaker":"常九爷","speaker_raw":"常九爷","text_hash":1503392573,"text":"可惜啊，我之前没时间写，就写了个开头给她，让她自己先看，准备以后有时间再慢慢写给她。","raw_text":"可惜啊，我之前没时间写，就写了个开头给她，让她自己先看，准备以后有时间再慢慢写给她。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211505.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2211505,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211505,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":221150508,"next_line_ids":[221150509],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1624,"speaker_text_hash":4046583941,"speaker":"常九爷","speaker_raw":"常九爷","text_hash":1566857109,"text":"但是那丫头突然有一天就不见了，我怎么找都找不着…","raw_text":"但是那丫头突然有一天就不见了，我怎么找都找不着…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211505.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2211505,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211505,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":221150509,"next_line_ids":[221150510],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1624,"speaker_text_hash":4046583941,"speaker":"常九爷","speaker_raw":"常九爷","text_hash":1269455533,"text":"哼，准是她家里人不喜欢我，不想她和我在一起，就找了个机会，不声不响地带着她，整家从轻策庄里搬走了。","raw_text":"哼，准是她家里人不喜欢我，不想她和我在一起，就找了个机会，不声不响地带着她，整家从轻策庄里搬走了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211505.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2211505,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211505,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":221150510,"next_line_ids":[221150511],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1624,"speaker_text_hash":4046583941,"speaker":"常九爷","speaker_raw":"常九爷","text_hash":2481593973,"text":"他们就瞧好吧，等我发了家，一准让他们刮目相看！然后，我就把我写给我妹子的那本书，给弄到全世界去卖！","raw_text":"他们就瞧好吧，等我发了家，一准让他们刮目相看！然后，我就把我写给我妹子的那本书，给弄到全世界去卖！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211505.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2211505,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211505,"sequence":10,"variant":0,"line_id":221150511,"next_line_ids":[221150512],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1624,"speaker_text_hash":4046583941,"speaker":"常九爷","speaker_raw":"常九爷","text_hash":4245922341,"text":"这样，无论她们现在住在哪，都能知道我老常已经混出了头！不是当年那个我了！","raw_text":"这样，无论她们现在住在哪，都能知道我老常已经混出了头！不是当年那个我了！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211505.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2211505,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211505,"sequence":11,"variant":0,"line_id":221150512,"next_line_ids":[221150513],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1624,"speaker_text_hash":4046583941,"speaker":"常九爷","speaker_raw":"常九爷","text_hash":1438177813,"text":"然后…我就一定能和她再见面…不过在那之前，我还是先得把这本书给写完了。","raw_text":"然后…我就一定能和她再见面…不过在那之前，我还是先得把这本书给写完了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211505.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2211505,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211505,"sequence":12,"variant":0,"line_id":221150513,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1624,"speaker_text_hash":4046583941,"speaker":"常九爷","speaker_raw":"常九爷","text_hash":476908157,"text":"…对不住，说着说着就唠叨起来了。唉，我还是再想想怎么写好我的那本书吧…","raw_text":"…对不住，说着说着就唠叨起来了。唉，我还是再想想怎么写好我的那本书吧…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211505.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":2211506,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211506,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":221150601,"next_line_ids":[221150602],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2306,"speaker_text_hash":4026615133,"speaker":"若心","speaker_raw":"若心","text_hash":1209011861,"text":"唉，这个小常啊…","raw_text":"唉，这个小常啊…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211506.json"}
