{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":2211506,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211506,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":221150605,"next_line_ids":[221150606],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2306,"speaker_text_hash":4026615133,"speaker":"若心","speaker_raw":"若心","text_hash":677936085,"text":"好啦，你们也别太操心了，这是小常他自己的事情。","raw_text":"好啦，你们也别太操心了，这是小常他自己的事情。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211506.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22115","main_id":22115,"main_title":"久久望故人","main_description":"轻策庄的常九爷说自己去「无妄坡」取材，却迟迟没有回来，若心奶奶有些担心…","chapter_title":"久久望故人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":2211506,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2211506,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":221150606,"next_line_ids":[221150607],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2306,"speaker_text_hash":4026615133,"speaker":"若心","speaker_raw":"若心","text_hash":3261499141,"text":"谢谢你们帮我跑了一趟。这是给你们的，收下吧。","raw_text":"谢谢你们帮我跑了一趟。这是给你们的，收下吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2211506.json"}
